ht":"Considering the sizeees... Of your guys' hooomes..."},{"chara":[{"id":304801}],"nameRight":"Hotaru","textRight":"I'd think you two wouuuld...@Go to a rich kid's schoool~..."},{"chara":[{"id":304801,"motion":400,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Hotaru","textRight":"You knooow...like St. Lilianaaa...@Or somethiing~..."},{"chara":[{"id":305701,"lipSynch":0,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"…………"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":305701,"motion":100}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"Big Bro Haruto went to Sakae Academy,"},{"chara":[{"id":305701}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"so I asked Papa and Mama if I could go there too..."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":304801,"motion":100,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Hotaru","textRight":"Mm~...theeen... What about Nikaidoooo~...?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":305701,"motion":1}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"Big bro... Why'd he go? Because it's close?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_000.exp3.json","id":304801}],"nameRight":"Hotaru","textRight":"But if he went to a rich schoool... He'd be able@to take a car thoouugh~...?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":305701}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"Hmm...[chara:305701:lipSynch_0][wait:0.8][chara:305701:lipSynch_1][chara:305701:cheek_0][chara:305701:face_mtn_ex_050.exp3.json]ah—!"},{"armatureList":[{"animation":["action"],"armatureId":1,"filePath":"resource/image_native/effect/story/general/3003_act_picture.ExportJson","zOrder":"messageBack"}],"autoTurnLast":0.01,"bg":"bg_adv_21461.jpg","bgm":"stop","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn","turnEffect":"sepiaFrame"},{"nameNarration":"Haruto Nikaido","narration":"In that case, maybe I'll go@to Sakae Academy since it's close.","narrationEffect":"in","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"narration":"So don't cry anymore, Akari."},{"autoTurnLast":0.01,"bg":"bg_adv_19261.jpg","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":305701,"motion":1,"pos":0},{"chee