xaaactly... Acquainted or anythiiing..."},{"chara":[{"id":304801}],"nameRight":"Hotaru","textRight":"With that Kaharu ladyyy..."},{"chara":[{"id":304801}],"nameRight":"Hotaru","textRight":"Calling her down wiill... Probably be a probleem~..."},{"chara":[{"id":305701,"motion":1}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"Any way we could get help?"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":305701},{"effect":"fadeout","id":304801}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_040.exp3.json","id":304101,"motion":1,"pos":1}],"nameCenter":"Hotori","textCenter":"Ummmm...are you having trouble...?@Is there anything I could do to help?"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":304101}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":305701,"motion":0,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":304801,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"Eh—?@Ah...[chara:305701:lipSynch_0][wait:0.8][chara:305701:lipSynch_1][chara:305701:cheek_0][chara:305701:face_mtn_ex_010.exp3.json][chara:305701:motion_100]thank you kindly."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":304801,"motion":100}],"nameRight":"Hotaru","textRight":"Woww~...that's some luuuck~..."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":305701,"motion":1,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"Well, there's actually someone we want to see..."},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":305701},{"effect":"fadeout","id":304801}],"textClear":1},{"autoTurnLast":0.1,"bg":"bg_adv_19261.jpg","bgChangeEffect":"cameraPan"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":304501,"motion":200,"pos":2},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":305001,"motion":0,"pos":0}],"nameRight":"Rion","textRight":"Hold it, Hotorin!"},{"chara":[{"id":304501}],"nameRight":"Rion","textRight":"What do you think you're doing running off@without me?!"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":305001,"motion":100,"pos":0}],"na